    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balang'hani Ba Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A balang'hani ba Hekalu baalī bagabanhyiwa mu magele kūlondeela ndīīma jabo. Ū ng'wigele lya ng'wa Koola walīmo Meshelemia ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Koole; nang'hwe walī ūmò wa banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Asafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Meshelemia walī na bitūnja: Zakalia, myalwa wakwe wa kwandya; wa kabīlī Yedieli wa kadatū Zebadia, wa kanè Yasinieli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa katanò Elamu, wa katandatū Yehohanani, wa mpungatī Eliehoenai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Obedi-edomu nang'hwe walī na bitūnja: Ū myalwa wa kwandya walī Shemaya, wa kabīlī Yehozabadi, wa kadatū Yoa, wa kanè Sakali, wa katanò Nesaneeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa katandatū Amieli, wa mpungatī Isakaali, wa kanaane Peuletai. (Ū Mulungu walī wang'wīlūkīla mbango no ū Obedi-edomu). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Shemaya nang'hwe walī na bitūnja; nabo baalī banhū ba būdūla būtaale, na lūūlū ū kū shikū ja kū būtongi bakatūūlwa būtongeeji ū mu ndūgū ja numba ya ng'wa saabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bitūnja ba ng'wa Shemaya benabo baalī: Osini, Lefaeli, Obedi, na Elizabadi. Na badūgū bakwe walī nabo, mina gabo ba Elihu na Semakia; nabo baalī banhū ba būdūla būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bose benaba baalī banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Obedi-edomu; nīyo pye a boi hamò na a bitūnja babo na a badūgū babo, baalī banhū ba būdūla na nguzu ja kwīta milīmo. A banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Obedi-edomu a bose baalī makūmi atandatū na babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Meshelimia ū ng'wene a bitūnja bakwe, kūbasanja na a badūgūye a bose, baalī ikūmi na banaane; nabo baalī ba būdūla mu milīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Hosa wa mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Melali walī na bitūnja: ū ntaale wabo walī Shimili (gwike a hene ū wei walī atī myalwa wa kwandya, alīyo ū ise walī wangūngūhya ūng'wīta kūbiza ntaale). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kabīlī Hilikia, wa kadatū Tabalia, wa kanè Zakalia. A bitūnja na a badūgū ba ng'wa Hosa a bose baalī ikūmi na badatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A balang'hani ba Hekalu benaba baalī bagabanhije mu magele, būl'igele na ntongeeji walyo; na būlī lyene lyalī na lūdīīma lwa kūtūmama ū mu hekalu ya ng'wa Seeba gīt'ūmo bīītīlaga a badūgū babo a ba kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a balang'hani ba ha nyango, babize bataale nūūlū bado, basolagwa bo mbale mu būlenganīja, kūlondeela kaya jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbale ya nyango gwa kū kīya īkangwīla Shelemia. Hanuma ya henaho nū ng'witūnja wakwe ū Zakalia ūsolwa bo mbale. Ū munhū ng'wenūyo walī ndeeba mu kūganikīla banhū, ū ng'wene ī mbale yūngwīla ya kū nyango gwa sukuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Obedi-edomu ūgwīlwa mbale ya kūlang'hana nyango gwa dakama; a bitūnja bakwe yūbagwīla mbale ya kūlang'hana nyango gwa ha chumba sha kūtūūla shikolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mbale ja kū mita gwa ng'weli nū gwa Shaleketi, ūyo gūlī kwikūūwa lya kūja kū ngūngūli, ī jene jūbagwīla ba Shupimu na Hosa; būlī ng'wene na lūdīīma lwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū nyango gwa kīya balang'hanga koi Balawī batandatū būlī lūshikū, ū gwa sukuma banè, nū gwa dakama banè, a ha chumba sha kūtūūla shikolo baalī bahelilwe kūbiza hoi babīlī būlī ikanza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū ng'weli, a ha nzīla ya kūja ha gwalugwa, baalī bahelelwa hoi balang'hani banè, a ha gwalugwa henekīlī babīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A genaya h'a magele ga balang'hani ba Hekalu, abo baalī ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Koola na Melali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balang'hani ba sabo, na bangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Balawī bichaabo baalī na ndīīma ja kūlang'hana ī chumba sha kūtūūla sabo īsho shaalī mu numba ya ng'wa Mulungu, nī chumba sha kūlang'hana shikolo īsho shaalī sheejiwa hūna shūtūūlwa kūlī Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Ladani, abo baalī ba kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Gelishoni, abo baalī bataale ba kaya ja mu ndūgū ja shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Gelishoni, baalī Yehieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bitūnja ba ng'wa Yehieli, Zetamu na ng'wana wa ng'wawe Yoeli. A benabo baalī balang'hani ba chūmba sha kūbīkīla sabo, īsho shalī mu hekalu ya ng'wa Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu ndūgū ja ba Amulamu, Iziha, Hebuloni na Uzieli, baalīho: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shubaeli, munhū wa sbibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Gelishomu, ūyo walī ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Musa; ū ng'wenūyo hū walī ntaale wa balang'hani ba chumba sha kūbīkīla sabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A badūgūye mu nzīla ya ng'wa Elieza baalī: ng'witūnja wakwe Lehabia, ng'witūnja wakwe Yeshaya, ng'witūnja wakwe Yolamu, ng'wigtūnja wakwe Zikili, ng'witūnja wakwe Shelomitī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Shalomitī na a badūgū bakwe baalī na ndīīma ja kūlang'hana ī shikolo pye ī shose īsho shalī shafunyiwa na ntemi Daūdi, nī shisho shalī shatūūlwa na bataale ba ndūgū jabo, abo baalī bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī-shihūmbī, na ga bashilikale igana-igana, na a bataale ba mabità a bangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shikolo shimò na shimò īsho shalī shading'wa mu būlūgū baalī bashitūūla ho kūlwa nguno ya kūbeegelegeja hekalu ya ng'wa Seeba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikolo pye īsho shalī shatūūlwa na ng'hangi Sang'weli, na Saulo ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Kishi, na Abneeli ng'witūnja wa ng'wa Neeli, na Yoabu ng'wana Seluya, nī shikolo ī shingī īsho shalī shatūūlwa, shalī ha sīlīlī ya būlang'hani wa ng'wa Shelomitī hamò na badūgūye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kūfuma ū mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Iziha, walīmo Kenania na bitūnja bakwe; ū ng'wene akinhwa nīmo gwa kūtūmamīla kūle nī hekalu. A banhū ba shibyalīlwe shakwe binhwa milīmo ya mu ofisi, bangī bīītwa kūbiza balamuji ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
